## 🚀 API Routes

All API endpoints are prefixed with `/api/`.

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose | Permission |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `auth/login/` | `POST` | Obtain JWT access/refresh tokens | Allow Any |
| `auth/refresh/` | `POST` | Refresh expired access token | Allow Any |
| `projects/` | `GET` | List all projects | Allow Any |
| `projects/` | `POST` | Create a new project | Admin Only |
| `projects/{id}/` | `GET` | Retrieve project details | Allow Any |
| `projects/{id}/` | `PUT/PATCH` | Update a project | Admin Only |
| `projects/{id}/` | `DELETE` | Delete a project | Admin Only |
| `blogs/` | `GET` | List blogs (Published only for public) | Allow Any |
| `blogs/` | `POST` | Create a new blog post | Admin Only |
| `experience/` | `GET/POST` | List or Create work experiences | IsAdminOrReadOnly |
| `skills/` | `GET/POST` | List or Create skills | IsAdminOrReadOnly |
| `contact/` | `POST` | Submit a contact form message | Allow Any |
| `contact/` | `GET` | View all contact messages | Admin Only |
| `resume/` | `GET/POST` | List or Upload resumes | IsAdminOrReadOnly |
| `resume/current/` | `GET` | Retrieve the currently active resume | Allow Any |
| `schema/` | `GET` | Download OpenAPI schema (YAML/JSON) | Allow Any |
| `docs/` | `GET` | Interactive Swagger UI documentation | Allow Any |

